Test `org.traccar.protocol.Gt06ProtocolDecoderTest::testDecode` error:
```
java.lang.IndexOutOfBoundsException: readerIndex(26) + length(2) exceeds writerIndex(27): UnpooledHeapByteBuf(ridx: 26, widx: 27, cap: 27/27)
```


Please provide a fixed version of the buggy function, and only that function, inside a code block.

ground_truth:
diff --git a/src/main/java/org/traccar/protocol/Gt06ProtocolDecoder.java b/src/main/java/org/traccar/protocol/Gt06ProtocolDecoder.java
index 15588c8..ef09677 100644
--- a/src/main/java/org/traccar/protocol/Gt06ProtocolDecoder.java
+++ b/src/main/java/org/traccar/protocol/Gt06ProtocolDecoder.java
